{"1": {"name": "Studio video tutorials", "desc": "<p>Short videos of dpCREATOR Studio, one topic at a time, from the first run to a finished job. Videos marked Studio Pro show features of the Pro plan; you can try Pro free for 14 days.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#studio-00-intro\">Studio Pro in 90 seconds</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-01-first-run\">First run</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-02-drawing\">Drawing shapes</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-03-text\">Text</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-04-import\">Importing</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-05-cut-types\">Cut types and depth</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-06-material-bits\">Material and bits</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-07-tabs-dogbones\">Tabs, dogbones and direction</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-08-preview-check\">Preview and check</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-09-make-send\">Make g-code and send</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-10-vcarve\">V-carving</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-11-several-bits\">Several bits</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-12-relief\">3D relief carving</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-13-laser\">Laser</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-14-shape-tools\">Shape tools and layout</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-15-box-inlay\">Box maker and inlays</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-16-machine\">Working with the machine</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-17-designs-settings\">Designs, backups and settings</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"studio-00-intro\">Studio Pro in 90 seconds</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-00-intro.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-00-intro.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Design, CAM and g-code in your browser: what Studio does, from a drawing to a cut. (1:33)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-01-first-run\">First run</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-01-first-run.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-01-first-run.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Tell Studio about your machine and your material: size, orientation, home corner and stock. (1:14)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-02-drawing\">Drawing shapes</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-02-drawing.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-02-drawing.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Rectangles, circles, polygons, stars and lines: the drawing tools you need for signs and parts. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-03-text\">Text</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-03-text.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-03-text.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Lettering the machine can cut: fonts, curved text, serial numbers, and what the machine does with it. (0:58)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-04-import\">Importing</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-04-import.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-04-import.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Bring in SVG, DXF, PDF and pictures from other programs instead of drawing everything in Studio. (1:22)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-05-cut-types\">Cut types and depth</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-05-cut-types.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-05-cut-types.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>What the machine should do with each shape: cut out, cut a hole, engrave the line or carve out the area, and how deep. (1:11)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-06-material-bits\">Material and bits</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-06-material-bits.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-06-material-bits.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Safe feeds and speeds worked out for you: pick the material, then a bit from the library or your own. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-07-tabs-dogbones\">Tabs, dogbones and direction</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-07-tabs-dogbones.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-07-tabs-dogbones.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>The cutting details that make a part come out right: hold it in place, clean inside corners, climb or conventional. (1:12)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-08-preview-check\">Preview and check</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-08-preview-check.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-08-preview-check.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>See the cut before you make it: the 3D preview and the checks that catch mistakes. (1:31)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-09-make-send\">Make g-code and send</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-09-make-send.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-09-make-send.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>From Studio to the machine: make the g-code and send it to the controller. (1:03)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-10-vcarve\">V-carving <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-10-vcarve.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-10-vcarve.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Crisp, bevelled letters and logos with a V-shaped bit. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-11-several-bits\">Several bits</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-11-several-bits.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-11-several-bits.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>One job, the right bit for every part: a flat bit for clearing, a smaller one for detail. (1:16)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-12-relief\">3D relief carving <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-12-relief.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-12-relief.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Turn a grey picture or an STL model into a carved relief. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-13-laser\">Laser <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-13-laser.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-13-laser.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Power, speed and passes instead of a bit: Studio Pro works with lasers too. (1:15)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-14-shape-tools\">Shape tools and layout</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-14-shape-tools.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-14-shape-tools.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Combine, round, copy and nest: simple shapes made into almost any part. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-15-box-inlay\">Box maker and inlays</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-15-box-inlay.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-15-box-inlay.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Two project helpers: finger-jointed boxes, and matching pockets and plugs for inlays. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-16-machine\">Working with the machine</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-16-machine.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-16-machine.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Studio and the WebUI together: offcuts, measured parts and waypoints from the machine. (0:58)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-17-designs-settings\">Designs, backups and settings</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-17-designs-settings.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-17-designs-settings.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Keep your work safe, and price your jobs. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><p>Read more in the <a href=\"/docs/dpcreator-studio\">Studio guide</a>, or see the <a href=\"/docs/webui-video-tutorials\">WebUI video tutorials</a>.</p>", "meta": "Short videos of dpCREATOR Studio: drawing, text, tabs, preview, g-code, V-carving, relief, laser and more."}, "2": {"name": "Studio video pamācības", "desc": "<p>Īsi video par dpCREATOR Studio, katrs par vienu tēmu, no pirmās palaišanas līdz gatavam darbam. Video ar atzīmi Studio Pro rāda Pro plāna funkcijas; Pro var izmēģināt bez maksas 14 dienas. Balss un subtitri ir angļu valodā.</p><p>Video ir angļu valodā.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#studio-00-intro\">Studio Pro 90 sekundēs</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-01-first-run\">Pirmā palaišana</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-02-drawing\">Formu zīmēšana</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-03-text\">Teksts</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-04-import\">Importēšana</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-05-cut-types\">Griezuma veidi un dziļums</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-06-material-bits\">Materiāls un frēzes</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-07-tabs-dogbones\">Turētāji, dogbones un virziens</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-08-preview-check\">Priekšskatījums un pārbaude</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-09-make-send\">G-koda izveide un nosūtīšana</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-10-vcarve\">V-griešana</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-11-several-bits\">Vairākas frēzes</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-12-relief\">3D reljefa griešana</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-13-laser\">Lāzers</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-14-shape-tools\">Formu rīki un izkārtojums</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-15-box-inlay\">Kastu veidotājs un inkrustācijas</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-16-machine\">Darbs ar mašīnu</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-17-designs-settings\">Projekti, rezerves kopijas un iestatījumi</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"studio-00-intro\">Studio Pro 90 sekundēs</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-00-intro.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-00-intro.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Projektēšana, CAM un G-kods pārlūkā: ko Studio dara, no zīmējuma līdz griezumam. (1:33)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-01-first-run\">Pirmā palaišana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-01-first-run.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-01-first-run.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Pastāstiet Studio par savu mašīnu un materiālu: izmērs, orientācija, sākuma stūris un sagatave. (1:14)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-02-drawing\">Formu zīmēšana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-02-drawing.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-02-drawing.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Taisnstūri, apļi, daudzstūri, zvaigznes un līnijas: zīmēšanas rīki zīmēm un detaļām. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-03-text\">Teksts</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-03-text.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-03-text.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Burti, ko mašīna var izgriezt: fonti, izliekts teksts, sērijas numuri un ko mašīna ar to dara. (0:58)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-04-import\">Importēšana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-04-import.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-04-import.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Ievietojiet SVG, DXF, PDF un attēlus no citām programmām, nevis zīmējiet visu Studio. (1:22)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-05-cut-types\">Griezuma veidi un dziļums</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-05-cut-types.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-05-cut-types.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Ko mašīnai darīt ar katru formu: izgriezt, izgriezt caurumu, gravēt līniju vai izfrēzēt laukumu, un cik dziļi. (1:11)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-06-material-bits\">Materiāls un frēzes</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-06-material-bits.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-06-material-bits.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Drošas padeves un apgriezieni aprēķināti jūsu vietā: izvēlieties materiālu, tad frēzi no bibliotēkas vai savu. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-07-tabs-dogbones\">Turētāji, dogbones un virziens</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-07-tabs-dogbones.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-07-tabs-dogbones.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Griešanas detaļas, lai detaļa izdotos: noturiet to vietā, tīri iekšējie stūri, griešanas virziens. (1:12)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-08-preview-check\">Priekšskatījums un pārbaude</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-08-preview-check.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-08-preview-check.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Redziet griezumu, pirms to veicat: 3D priekšskatījums un pārbaudes, kas atrod kļūdas. (1:31)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-09-make-send\">G-koda izveide un nosūtīšana</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-09-make-send.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-09-make-send.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>No Studio līdz mašīnai: izveidojiet G-kodu un nosūtiet to uz kontrolieri. (1:03)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-10-vcarve\">V-griešana <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-10-vcarve.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-10-vcarve.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Asi, slīpi burti un logotipi ar V veida frēzi. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-11-several-bits\">Vairākas frēzes</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-11-several-bits.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-11-several-bits.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Viens darbs, katrai daļai pareizā frēze: plakana tīrīšanai, mazāka detaļām. (1:16)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-12-relief\">3D reljefa griešana <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-12-relief.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-12-relief.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Pārvērtiet pelēku attēlu vai STL modeli izgrieztā reljefā. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-13-laser\">Lāzers <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-13-laser.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-13-laser.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Jauda, ātrums un piegājieni frēzes vietā: Studio Pro strādā arī ar lāzeriem. (1:15)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-14-shape-tools\">Formu rīki un izkārtojums</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-14-shape-tools.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-14-shape-tools.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Apvienot, noapaļot, kopēt un izvietot: no vienkāršām formām gandrīz jebkura detaļa. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-15-box-inlay\">Kastu veidotājs un inkrustācijas</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-15-box-inlay.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-15-box-inlay.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Divi projektu palīgi: kastes ar pirkstu savienojumiem un atbilstošas kabatas un ieliktņi inkrustācijām. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-16-machine\">Darbs ar mašīnu</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-16-machine.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-16-machine.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Studio un WebUI kopā: atgriezumi, izmērītas detaļas un punkti no mašīnas. (0:58)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-17-designs-settings\">Projekti, rezerves kopijas un iestatījumi</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-17-designs-settings.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-17-designs-settings.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Glabājiet savu darbu drošībā un aprēķiniet darbu cenu. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><p>Vairāk lasiet <a href=\"/docs/dpcreator-studio\">Studio ceļvedī</a> vai skatiet <a href=\"/docs/webui-video-tutorials\">WebUI video pamācības</a>.</p>", "meta": "Īsi video par dpCREATOR Studio: zīmēšana, teksts, turētāji, priekšskatījums, G-kods, V-griešana, reljefs, lāzers un citi."}, "3": {"name": "Studio Video-Tutorials", "desc": "<p>Kurze Videos zu dpCREATOR Studio, jeweils zu einem Thema, vom ersten Start bis zum fertigen Job. Mit Studio Pro markierte Videos zeigen Funktionen des Pro-Tarifs; Pro können Sie 14 Tage kostenlos testen. Sprache und Untertitel sind auf Englisch.</p><p>Die Videos sind auf Englisch.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#studio-00-intro\">Studio Pro in 90 Sekunden</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-01-first-run\">Erster Start</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-02-drawing\">Formen zeichnen</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-03-text\">Text</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-04-import\">Importieren</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-05-cut-types\">Schnittarten und Tiefe</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-06-material-bits\">Material und Fräser</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-07-tabs-dogbones\">Haltestege, Dogbones und Richtung</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-08-preview-check\">Vorschau und Prüfung</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-09-make-send\">G-Code erzeugen und senden</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-10-vcarve\">V-Carving</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-11-several-bits\">Mehrere Fräser</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-12-relief\">3D-Reliefs fräsen</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-13-laser\">Laser</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-14-shape-tools\">Formwerkzeuge und Anordnung</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-15-box-inlay\">Kistenbauer und Intarsien</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-16-machine\">Arbeiten mit der Maschine</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-17-designs-settings\">Entwürfe, Sicherungen und Einstellungen</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"studio-00-intro\">Studio Pro in 90 Sekunden</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-00-intro.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-00-intro.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Entwurf, CAM und G-Code im Browser: was Studio kann, von der Zeichnung bis zum Schnitt. (1:33)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-01-first-run\">Erster Start</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-01-first-run.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-01-first-run.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Studio Ihre Maschine und Ihr Material mitteilen: Größe, Ausrichtung, Referenzecke und Rohteil. (1:14)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-02-drawing\">Formen zeichnen</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-02-drawing.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-02-drawing.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Rechtecke, Kreise, Vielecke, Sterne und Linien: die Zeichenwerkzeuge für Schilder und Teile. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-03-text\">Text</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-03-text.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-03-text.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Schrift, die die Maschine fräsen kann: Schriftarten, gebogener Text, Seriennummern und was die Maschine damit macht. (0:58)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-04-import\">Importieren</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-04-import.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-04-import.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>SVG, DXF, PDF und Bilder aus anderen Programmen übernehmen, statt alles in Studio zu zeichnen. (1:22)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-05-cut-types\">Schnittarten und Tiefe</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-05-cut-types.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-05-cut-types.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Was die Maschine mit jeder Form tun soll: ausschneiden, ein Loch schneiden, die Linie gravieren oder die Fläche ausräumen, und wie tief. (1:11)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-06-material-bits\">Material und Fräser</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-06-material-bits.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-06-material-bits.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Sichere Vorschübe und Drehzahlen werden für Sie berechnet: Material wählen, dann einen Fräser aus der Bibliothek oder einen eigenen. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-07-tabs-dogbones\">Haltestege, Dogbones und Richtung</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-07-tabs-dogbones.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-07-tabs-dogbones.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Die Details, damit ein Teil gelingt: festhalten, saubere Innenecken, Gleich- oder Gegenlauf. (1:12)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-08-preview-check\">Vorschau und Prüfung</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-08-preview-check.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-08-preview-check.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Den Schnitt sehen, bevor er gemacht wird: die 3D-Vorschau und die Prüfungen, die Fehler finden. (1:31)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-09-make-send\">G-Code erzeugen und senden</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-09-make-send.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-09-make-send.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Von Studio zur Maschine: G-Code erzeugen und an den Controller senden. (1:03)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-10-vcarve\">V-Carving <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-10-vcarve.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-10-vcarve.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Scharfe, abgeschrägte Buchstaben und Logos mit einem V-Fräser. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-11-several-bits\">Mehrere Fräser</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-11-several-bits.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-11-several-bits.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Ein Job, für jeden Teil der richtige Fräser: ein flacher zum Ausräumen, ein kleinerer für Details. (1:16)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-12-relief\">3D-Reliefs fräsen <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-12-relief.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-12-relief.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Ein Graustufenbild oder ein STL-Modell als Relief fräsen. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-13-laser\">Laser <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-13-laser.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-13-laser.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Leistung, Geschwindigkeit und Durchgänge statt eines Fräsers: Studio Pro kann auch Laser. (1:15)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-14-shape-tools\">Formwerkzeuge und Anordnung</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-14-shape-tools.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-14-shape-tools.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Kombinieren, abrunden, kopieren und verschachteln: aus einfachen Formen fast jedes Teil. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-15-box-inlay\">Kistenbauer und Intarsien</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-15-box-inlay.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-15-box-inlay.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Zwei Projekthelfer: Kisten mit Fingerzinken und passende Taschen und Einlagen für Intarsien. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-16-machine\">Arbeiten mit der Maschine</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-16-machine.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-16-machine.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Studio und WebUI zusammen: Reststücke, vermessene Teile und Wegpunkte von der Maschine. (0:58)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-17-designs-settings\">Entwürfe, Sicherungen und Einstellungen</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-17-designs-settings.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-17-designs-settings.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Ihre Arbeit sicher aufbewahren und Ihre Aufträge kalkulieren. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><p>Mehr dazu in der <a href=\"/docs/dpcreator-studio\">Studio-Anleitung</a> oder in den <a href=\"/docs/webui-video-tutorials\">WebUI Video-Tutorials</a>.</p>", "meta": "Kurze Videos zu dpCREATOR Studio: Zeichnen, Text, Haltestege, Vorschau, G-Code, V-Carving, Relief, Laser und mehr."}, "4": {"name": "Видеоуроки по Studio", "desc": "<p>Короткие видео о dpCREATOR Studio, по одной теме в каждом, от первого запуска до готового задания. Видео с пометкой Studio Pro показывают функции тарифа Pro; Pro можно попробовать бесплатно 14 дней. Озвучка и субтитры на английском.</p><p>Видео на английском языке.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#studio-00-intro\">Studio Pro за 90 секунд</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-01-first-run\">Первый запуск</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-02-drawing\">Рисование фигур</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-03-text\">Текст</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-04-import\">Импорт</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-05-cut-types\">Типы резки и глубина</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-06-material-bits\">Материал и фрезы</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-07-tabs-dogbones\">Перемычки, dogbones и направление</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-08-preview-check\">Просмотр и проверка</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-09-make-send\">Создание и отправка G-кода</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-10-vcarve\">V-резьба</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-11-several-bits\">Несколько фрез</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-12-relief\">3D-рельеф</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-13-laser\">Лазер</a> (Studio Pro)</li><li><a href=\"#studio-14-shape-tools\">Инструменты фигур и раскладка</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-15-box-inlay\">Конструктор коробок и инкрустация</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-16-machine\">Работа со станком</a></li><li><a href=\"#studio-17-designs-settings\">Проекты, резервные копии и настройки</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"studio-00-intro\">Studio Pro за 90 секунд</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-00-intro.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-00-intro.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Проектирование, CAM и G-код в браузере: что умеет Studio, от чертежа до резки. (1:33)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-01-first-run\">Первый запуск</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-01-first-run.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-01-first-run.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Расскажите Studio о станке и материале: размер, ориентация, угол дома и заготовка. (1:14)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-02-drawing\">Рисование фигур</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-02-drawing.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-02-drawing.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Прямоугольники, круги, многоугольники, звёзды и линии: инструменты для табличек и деталей. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-03-text\">Текст</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-03-text.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-03-text.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Надписи, которые станок может вырезать: шрифты, текст по дуге, серийные номера и что станок с ними делает. (0:58)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-04-import\">Импорт</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-04-import.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-04-import.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Загружайте SVG, DXF, PDF и изображения из других программ, а не рисуйте всё в Studio. (1:22)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-05-cut-types\">Типы резки и глубина</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-05-cut-types.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-05-cut-types.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Что станок делает с каждой фигурой: вырезать, вырезать отверстие, гравировать линию или выбрать область, и на какую глубину. (1:11)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-06-material-bits\">Материал и фрезы</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-06-material-bits.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-06-material-bits.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Безопасные подачи и обороты рассчитываются за вас: выберите материал, затем фрезу из библиотеки или свою. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-07-tabs-dogbones\">Перемычки, dogbones и направление</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-07-tabs-dogbones.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-07-tabs-dogbones.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Детали резки, чтобы деталь получилась: удержать её, чистые внутренние углы, попутное или встречное фрезерование. (1:12)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-08-preview-check\">Просмотр и проверка</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-08-preview-check.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-08-preview-check.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Увидьте резку до того, как она начнётся: 3D-просмотр и проверки, которые находят ошибки. (1:31)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-09-make-send\">Создание и отправка G-кода</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-09-make-send.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-09-make-send.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Из Studio на станок: создайте G-код и отправьте его на контроллер. (1:03)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-10-vcarve\">V-резьба <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-10-vcarve.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-10-vcarve.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Чёткие буквы и логотипы с фаской V-образной фрезой. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-11-several-bits\">Несколько фрез</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-11-several-bits.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-11-several-bits.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Одно задание, своя фреза для каждой части: плоская для выборки, меньшая для деталей. (1:16)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-12-relief\">3D-рельеф <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-12-relief.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-12-relief.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Превратите серое изображение или STL-модель в вырезанный рельеф. (1:17)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-13-laser\">Лазер <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#1f6feb;color:#fff;vertical-align:middle\">Studio Pro</span></h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-13-laser.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-13-laser.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Мощность, скорость и проходы вместо фрезы: Studio Pro работает и с лазерами. (1:15)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-14-shape-tools\">Инструменты фигур и раскладка</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-14-shape-tools.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-14-shape-tools.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Объединение, скругление, копирование и раскладка: из простых фигур почти любая деталь. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-15-box-inlay\">Конструктор коробок и инкрустация</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-15-box-inlay.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-15-box-inlay.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Два помощника: коробки на шипах и подходящие карманы и вставки для инкрустации. (1:06)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-16-machine\">Работа со станком</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-16-machine.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-16-machine.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Studio и WebUI вместе: обрезки, измеренные детали и точки со станка. (0:58)</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"studio-17-designs-settings\">Проекты, резервные копии и настройки</h2><figure style=\"margin:18px 0 8px\"><video controls preload=\"metadata\" playsinline poster=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-17-designs-settings.jpg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:960px;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;background:#000\"><source src=\"/image/catalog/dpc-site/video/studio-17-designs-settings.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><figcaption>Храните работу в безопасности и считайте цену заказов. (1:02)</figcaption></figure><p>Подробнее — в <a href=\"/docs/dpcreator-studio\">руководстве по Studio</a>, а также <a href=\"/docs/webui-video-tutorials\">видеоуроки по WebUI</a>.</p>", "meta": "Короткие видео о dpCREATOR Studio: рисование, текст, перемычки, просмотр, G-код, V-резьба, рельеф, лазер и другое."}}